Subject: [PATCH 11/14] fix(linux): relocate desktop icon to declared hicolor
 512x512 (spec fix)

---
 .../resources/linux/desktop-icon-fixup.sh     | 27 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../pack/resources/linux/rpm-after-install.sh | 16 -----------
 tools/pack/src/linux.ts                       |  8 +++++-
 tools/pack/src/resources/index.ts             |  9 ++++---
